Package: cockpit-pistomp-support
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: pistomp <pistomp@example.com>
Depends: cockpit-bridge, python3, python3-minimal
Description: Cockpit module to download a redacted pi-Stomp support bundle
 Adds a "Support logs" tool to Cockpit. After an explicit privacy consent,
 it collects journals and service diagnostics, redacts personal identifiers
 (IPs, MACs, emails, home paths, SSIDs, USB serials, secrets), and offers
 a .tar.gz download. Nothing is uploaded automatically — the user sends
 the archive manually.
